---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="信号丢失" description="请求的页面不存在。">
  <section class="not-found shell">
    <span class="eyebrow">ERROR / 404 / SIGNAL LOST</span>
    <strong>404</strong>
    <h1>这条信号没有抵达。</h1>
    <p>页面可能已经移动，或者地址输入有误。你可以回到知识网络，重新选择路径。</p>
    <a class="button primary" href="/">返回首页 →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; justify-content: center; min-height: 70vh; }
  .not-found > strong { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--border); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: clamp(8rem, 30vw, 22rem); line-height: 0.8; letter-spacing: -0.08em; }
  .not-found h1 { margin: 30px 0 10px; color: var(--text-strong); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .not-found p { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 0 26px; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
